# pnpm settings live in pnpm-workspace.yaml (the v10 home), where camelCase
# `minimumReleaseAge` and `overrides` are honored. Do NOT set minimumReleaseAge
# here as camelCase — in .npmrc pnpm only reads the kebab-case
# `minimum-release-age`, and either form also makes npm/npx warn. Kept empty so
# there is one source of truth for the supply-chain freshness guard.
